# Delver of Secrets: "If an instant or sorcery card is revealed this way, transform." A sorcery transforms it as an instant
# does: on Bot1's turn-3 upkeep the top card is Ponder, revealed, and Delver becomes Insectile Aberration, a 3/2 flier.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Delver of Secrets
Island x5
Ponder
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Delver of Secrets.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Insectile Aberration
Bot1.Battlefield.Insectile Aberration.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Insectile Aberration.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Revealed = Ponder
